lrx="930" lry="1321" /><zone xml:id="m-2e47acf4-6825-46fc-8241-5327bbb677bc" ulx="58" uly="1329" lrx="930" lry="1373" /><zone xml:id="m-5a167a38-123f-4952-9e4c-acd03dae9483" ulx="488" uly="1362" lrx="931" lry="1393" /><zone xml:id="m-f6b1ce4e-3ab4-4d40-8f54-171ab3929c15" ulx="39" uly="1364" lrx="479" lry="1401" /><zone xml:id="m-df4c931f-b946-4692-9dc2-500ebf40b9c3" ulx="39" uly="1389" lrx="480" lry="1421" /><zone xml:id="m-81d5fef3-3df1-48a1-bfe8-c9f207bdded4" ulx="490" uly="1389" lrx="932" lry="1422" /><zone xml:id="m-9a3ed607-b49f-4f96-be9a-e091a242ce4f" ulx="492" uly="1416" lrx="931" lry="1450" /><zone xml:id="m-378bfd17-3005-4689-a7f5-79f2446c147e" ulx="38" uly="1418" lrx="477" lry="1452" /><zone xml:id="m-1458c14c-6310-432b-bdb7-6831bf28412e" ulx="492" uly="1444" lrx="930" lry="1476" /><zone xml:id="m-2446fdb5-99ef-4eec-a3c7-379048389afe" ulx="38" uly="1449" lrx="475" lry="1479" /><zone xml:id="m-aa5344ed-6d39-4f5d-bf0b-a45b8968f8d7" ulx="37" uly="1472" lrx="477" lry="1508" /><zone xml:id="m-ae408a05-3158-4657-8b33-7953583cbdb4" ulx="490" uly="1476" lrx="929" lry="1507" /><zone xml:id="m-3a68c0af-1315-4b4f-beb5-f38b95823899" ulx="38" uly="1500" lrx="476" lry="1538" /><zone xml:id="m-e94ea432-ccba-4e86-b2d9-16f962df1515" ulx="489" uly="1500" lrx="929" lry="1532" /><zone xml:id="m-9f741298-8452-4b1b-bf3f-6fa3fbe9da67" ulx="488" uly="1524" lrx="883" lry="1564" /><zone xml:id="m-0713fc7a-a0d1-4fc4-8ba7-4199fc9606ea" ulx="36" uly="1528" lrx="479" lry="1562" /><zone xml:id="m-305cf29f-de4a-4409-a460-d6bcff0aade7" ulx="36" uly="1559" lrx="483" lry="1597" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-b04158ea-e86c-432e-9f09-16dba578336f" n="2063" facs="#m-3535edc1-d841-4c9b-a03b-3a36c70976e7" /><div xml:id="m-c685f39b-9124-4441-9b49-ea89d8bb7181">
            <lg xml:id="m-ec0c691f-fe88-4c04-a265-1b7db4bda3db">
              <l xml:id="m-fe8dfeed-1bdf-429a-bf52-89121b5d79a0" facs="#m-2c6d5d29-7610-41d8-afd9-3173e872e44a" label="text-like">Masses for the Dead.</l><l xml:id="m-bdd461b3-bca2-4674-adb4-72d25de4f110" facs="#m-781e61da-96a4-46b1-b8a3-b87f381a9552" label="ambiguous">1s17</l><l xml:id="m-41b2d486-5796-49d5-bcca-bbb3058d81cb" facs="#m-e2aebe00-0d19-4975-aaeb-3524675779ce" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-112f07ff-9986-43c6-ba37-cb8330606964" facs="#m-a9157059-ebea-417f-a62d-260af04e1341" label="lyrics-like">ORopitiáre Dómine supplicatió- dies ágitur, pro qua (quibus) tibi</l><l xml:id="m-372b4b70-571e-4f7b-9bca-11fef6e2ad10" facs="#m-87bc51ca-4fd0-4034-8f78-c0fac40e97c0" label="lyrics-like">Lnibus nostris, pro ánima fámuli ]offérimus sacrificium laudis : ut eam</l><l xml:id="m-51b8bdf3-6339-4f11-b12f-0a5c127a48d3" facs="#m-38d18321-8a14-4d27-a4fe-08ce328269df" label="lyrics-like">tui N. (fámulae tuae N.. or animá¬</l><l xml:id="m-afbe574c-83df-40bf-b9f5-ba3b523bf4e6" facs="#m-efdb78a9-cced-46eb-ab4b-567b1bd3fb8f" label="lyrics-like">(eas) Sanctórum tuórum consórtio</l><l xml:id="m-0e7d97c6-5b52-4459-9ace-8290b7196d42" facs="#m-8a7c3bbc-e4bf-46a7-86c9-ea0e6a3254f9" label="lyrics-like">bus famulórum famularúmque tuá¬</l><l xml:id="m-2f7db5cd-487f-4ab3-9ffb-10fae7938e90" facs="#m-ca523283-f263-47d7-8378-5774856f8e09" label="lyrics-like">sociáre dignéris. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d6899581-cae3-4ea0-bee1-22b2731e4e29" facs="#m-5ed64de9-f767-43e5-8ad8-1b7ec991058c" label="lyrics-like">rum), cujus (quorum) hódie ánnua</l><l xml:id="m-de8ee02b-2e88-4b9b-91d3-37196341e93f" facs="#m-9713181e-556c-4b7a-bf21-9d7b862c9480" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-d71f31a8-1c27-4dcd-80b7-621ebe3cd4ee" facs="#m-463b1bca-dd5b-485d-a23b-6054f5f208cf" label="lyrics-like">DRaesta quaésumus Dómine: ut diem commemorámus; his purgáta</l><l xml:id="m-00d24ee1-5381-4820-94bf-88691bb3ca92" facs="#m-9423d588-3344-4397-bb30-fa66ee8e9828" label="lyrics-like">L ánima fámuli tui N. (famulae</l><l xml:id="m-750b84a7-c9d8-47ce-afe7-de3c75027ae5" facs="#m-5cc24458-28f1-442a-ac9a-e0e1ce5be715" label="lyrics-like">(purgatae) sacrificiis, indulgéntiam</l><l xml:id="m-011afe14-ba8d-4090-800d-37d380bf81d0" facs="#m-f2762977-6869-47bf-b38b-93f2b0835d8b" label="lyrics-like">tuae N, or ánimae famulórum páriter et réquiem cápiat (capiant)</l><l xml:id="m-0ff2c007-f26a-4ee3-9110-8dec9d5fef8e" facs="#m-b8c680d6-39fe-4ae7-a4a0-f0630c9d6db2" label="lyrics-like">famularúmque tuárum, cujus (quo¬</l><l xml:id="m-3226e1d3-d857-442b-b185-dc260a1e1983" facs="#m-1241726d-dd36-4ca2-8368-3aa23b3f53e0" label="lyrics-like">sempitérnam. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d3e4128b-50ea-4dfb-a7b4-cba3c84f8b31" facs="#m-6d046ce8-feb7-49cb-b26d-a260ae519220" label="lyrics-like">rum) anniversárium depositiõnis</l><l xml:id="m-19618b29-04fe-49b1-9aec-76b33219b80e" facs="#m-d3f8b396-f02a-4f64-aecf-81ccfafd6a2f" label="text-like">IV. — THE DAILY MASS FOR THE DEAD.</l><l xml:id="m-6fc488ae-39d9-44f7-adfd-710f460cfd14" facs="#m-a65b176d-d27e-456f-9a0b-3deb5034650a" label="text-like">The Mass is said as on the day of burial, p. 1807, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-b71daa24-9ddf-4354-9b80-d63deaddec20" facs="#m-2535f4f7-d165-450e-8ee0-6bc730b5fcf7" label="text-like">For deceased Bishops and Priests.</l><l xml:id="m-8af8c5d9-c3e6-4e5c-8171-349fbdf643c1" facs="#m-af15d8b2-2ad2-4732-9ef1-a63c0b4e8c17" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-7fab6b98-b126-4cb9-b18c-72bd96abf22c" facs="#m-df552bdc-1934-4558-a984-ab9af2a6b09b" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui inter apostólicos Sacer-gére : praesta quaésumus; ut eórum</l><l xml:id="m-4906ee03-82a3-4986-9f5b-acc0dc406f31" facs="#m-a96a05bd-2365-423e-8d00-06dd1793c608" label="lyrics-like">U dótes, fámulos tuos pontificáli ! quoque perpétuo aggregéntur con¬</l><l xml:id="m-bd75ddff-1823-440f-bc08-0064295bf794" facs="#m-f5c57b6b-45bf-4f14-b4a2-41781cf95ca7" label="lyrics-like">seu sacerdotáli fecísti dignitâte vi-l sórtio. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-981763cc-e324-4cdb-8961-9b6e2ed40522" facs="#m-46c182a1-73df-4b1d-9cd1-64e0fa47f72b" label="text-like">For deceased Brethren, Relations, and Benefactors.</l><l xml:id="m-9c393393-1943-4ac3-b7a3-e1f85111ba80" facs="#m-bfad558e-ba3f-42fa-be71-e14ca9151baa" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-b1d1b9d7-da6f-4b3d-9af2-b954647d3853" facs="#m-d05e4bdd-75ef-46a2-b7ad-4931d6f6d431" label="lyrics-like">Eus véniae largítor et humânae runt, beáta Maria semper Virgine</l><l xml:id="m-a4d2c073-6e34-494a-bbe3-a7b3034919d5" facs="#m-9efe6266-b063-4f8d-82d9-5f2a2aab9b01" label="lyrics-like">I salútis amátor : quaésumus cle-l intercedénte cum ómnibus sanctis</l><l xml:id="m-4a33bb42-0ad2-4a71-aea2-822abd833870" facs="#m-cc500930-145f-43fc-b55e-5386bcc226b2" label="lyrics-like">tuis, ad perpétuae beatitúdinis con¬</l><l xml:id="m-1526c4d4-4490-49d2-84c0-45fc114efe0a" facs="#m-36326797-638f-43b9-a3a5-68b9bffb4f99" label="lyrics-like">méntiam tuam; ut nostrae congre¬</l><l xml:id="m-086bc292-fa6a-4216-869e-f3081bd64028" facs="#m-35d21876-8db4-46b1-a631-887ad55887c3" label="lyrics-like">gatiónis fratres, propínquos et bene- sórtium pervenire concédas.</l><l xml:id="m-04b6a735-18c2-46ff-b462-5a5831221b9e" facs="#m-d84ad344-98f1-40c1-b90b-f4ac560ab790" label="lyrics-like">factóres, qui ex hoc saéculo transié¬</l><l xml:id="m-409c20bd-0eb3-41cb-ba62-a9ba47500e81" facs="#m-7525e7c2-e9cc-4815-8df1-136285caab90" label="lyrics-like">For all the Faithful departed. Collect. Fidélium. p. 1806.</l><l xml:id="m-7652d793-b2aa-49c7-8d67-812f21a5badd" facs="#m-5c3e6de8-6c4c-4963-8704-4273795e3d56" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Apocalypsis beati Joannis Apostoli. Apoc. 14, 13.</l><l xml:id="m-7087e759-e022-4d2b-a905-c8022262f48f" facs="#m-713a6858-59b6-46c7-9718-8ce07a96e6d9" label="lyrics-like">TN diébus illis : Audívi vocem de riúntur. Amodo jam dicit Spíritus,</l><l xml:id="m-8238e6b3-d56c-42b7-906b-06df3e143d3e" facs="#m-24717605-aba2-400a-9b0c-679c93bce087" label="lyrics-like">L caelo dicéntem mihi : Scribe: ut requiéscant a labóribus suis:</l><l xml:id="m-7eff65be-66a7-42c0-b29a-8a5b8c647984" facs="#m-ed7b733f-e230-4cea-b4cb-a0255a510f29" label="lyrics-like">Beáti mórtui qui in Dómino mo-lópera enim illórum sequuntur illos.</l><l xml:id="m-b6e00e68-4bca-49c1-8b5b-0861782ab06f" facs="#m-f356cc63-0a69-4ebd-9aeb-d6a78cc9ed3c" label="text-like">The Sequence Dies irae. may never be omitted when the Daily Mass is sung.</l><l xml:id="m-ec8cfe63-42e4-43b1-af43-91b7c9758fbe" facs="#m-d379828b-1668-41c4-b443-415ab1c97e56" label="text-like">In low Masses, it may be said or not, at the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-7aeb2ffc-55dc-4024-a002-208673e51e5c" facs="#m-8e9c05ca-5892-497d-bf93-1ca0e8a34ce6" label="ambiguous">★ Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joann. 6, 51-55.</l><l xml:id="m-1a2eb2ee-bd29-43d6-b045-ca69d18c2617" facs="#m-2e47acf4-6825-46fc-8241-5327bbb677bc" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus tur-] dum? Dixit ergo eis Jesus: Amen,</l><l xml:id="m-dcd33c8a-d51b-478f-9819-467375de9e1c" facs="#m-5a167a38-123f-4952-9e4c-acd03dae9483" label="lyrics-like">amen dico vobis: nisi manducavé¬</l><l xml:id="m-952564b3-df8c-46f2-878d-3a7b759d7912" facs="#m-f6b1ce4e-3ab4-4d40-8f54-171ab3929c15" label="lyrics-like">L bis Judaeörum: Ego sum panis</l><l xml:id="m-c5d3d9f1-7591-43cb-b384-1d04a2909c25" facs="#m-df4c931f-b946-4692-9dc2-500ebf40b9c3" label="lyrics-like">vivus dui de caelo descéndi. Si quis</l><l xml:id="m-c78a810f-2e6b-4da9-81d9-0c4610e98433" facs="#m-81d5fef3-3df1-48a1-bfe8-c9f207bdded4" label="lyrics-like">ritis carnem Filii hóminis, et bibéri¬</l><l xml:id="m-61dda6c2-22cb-4b92-bff4-4d5f0c7b506d" facs="#m-9a3ed607-b49f-4f96-be9a-e091a242ce4f" label="lyrics-like">tis ejus sánguinem, non habébitis</l><l xml:id="m-fc2f7801-87ee-40e4-b652-e785a11d1111" facs="#m-378bfd17-3005-4689-a7f5-79f2446c147e" label="ambiguous">manducaverit ex hoc pane, vivet in</l><l xml:id="m-6bfb0336-b89d-4d72-bc0d-ae38dfb8d9d2" facs="#m-1458c14c-6310-432b-bdb7-6831bf28412e" label="lyrics-like">vitam in vobis. Qui mandúcat meam</l><l xml:id="m-c68a92ac-0e4f-4d58-8f1b-0c920aae8cee" facs="#m-2446fdb5-99ef-4eec-a3c7-379048389afe" label="lyrics-like">aetérnum : et panis quem ego dabo,</l><l xml:id="m-5ba442cd-0f7e-4162-af76-f6cf17a9662b" facs="#m-aa5344ed-6d39-4f5d-bf0b-a45b8968f8d7" label="ambiguous">caro mea est pro mundi vita. Liti¬</l><l xml:id="m-63a7fee2-8662-4c09-979f-5625ed2a82b3" facs="#m-ae408a05-3158-4657-8b33-7953583cbdb4" label="lyrics-like">carnem et bibit meum sánguinem,</l><l xml:id="m-9935dbc1-7401-4233-afda-f78a7394844c" facs="#m-3a68c0af-1315-4b4f-beb5-f38b95823899" label="lyrics-like">gábant ergo Judaéi ad invicem, di¬</l><l xml:id="m-edaefd4e-eb4a-4a31-a952-7c22bf69f9a1" facs="#m-e94ea432-ccba-4e86-b2d9-16f962df1515" label="lyrics-like">habet vitam aetérnam: et ego re¬</l><l xml:id="m-be4ddc20-d869-4d5e-af70-0caf78686398" facs="#m-9f741298-8452-4b1b-bf3f-6fa3fbe9da67" label="lyrics-like">suscitábo eum in novissimo die.</l><l xml:id="m-915f5e12-a191-4e69-ab1c-774bd2bac601" facs="#m-0713fc7a-a0d1-4fc4-8ba7-4199fc9606ea" label="lyrics-like">céntes : Quómodo potest hic nobis</l><l xml:id="m-3b903e02-6b3e-4cf3-82ae-2b76559bb954" facs="#m-305cf29f-de4a-4409-a460-d6bcff0aade7" label="lyrics-like">carnem suam dare ad manducán¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>